# Campus Arena has no environment variables yet.
#
# When the backend is added (Phase 3), PUBLIC values (for example a Supabase
# project URL and its "anon" key) go here with a VITE_ prefix.
#
# NEVER put secret keys (service-role keys, payment API secrets, Telebirr
# credentials) in a VITE_ variable. Anything with that prefix is shipped to
# every visitor's browser. Secrets belong only in server-side functions.
